":{"login":"WolfgangSenff","id":148612,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODYxMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/148612?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff","html_url":"https://github.com/WolfgangSenff","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-10T13:19:49Z","updated_at":"2025-07-10T13:19:49Z","body":"I started making the changes for the ndk version and wanted to keep my notes here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105611/files#diff-bd7eca2c1bd3fef206b15a7db387521c06e08916209a8b4b5b607d245dc6c55bR116 leads to a very different file because all these lines are not in, nor are they replacing anything, in the 3.x branch. I don't know if they're necessary, or if these changes only exist because of the 4.x upgrades to the build system, and so aren't needed at all in 3.x, or if I have to update the entire 3.x file. Note I did not also add subprocess as an import because I think that came from 4.x changes only, and for the changes I made with the triple_target_dir, I left the names of the android_arches the same as they are for 3.x, since that isn't a change this should be making, I think, but I did try to properly match them to their relevant arches.\r\n\r\nSimilarly, some of these changes could not be made because something from 4.x crept in and doesn't exist in 3.x: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105611/files#diff-6c1cc3a2230de0e0f8d190e6eb907b7b77266df81602a1527c09480e3864fad3R98, but I did a best-guess effort to update for the previous changes in the same file.\r\n\r\nI have kept this in two separate commits, one for the NDK/Maven/16KB size updates, one for the general version number bumps. Let me know if I should squash them before this is merged, happy to do so.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3057434720/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3060122082","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108433#issuecomment-3060122082","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108433","id":3060122082,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62ZcHi","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-11T02:44:27Z","updated_at":"2025-07-11T02:44:27Z","body":"Note: Updating the target SDK to 35 enforces edge-to-edge mode by default. This leads to behavior differences between Android 15 and earlier versions. To address this, we should also backport the changes from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107742\r\n\r\nThat PR also introduces an export setting to toggle edge-to-edge mode, I'd recommend to not provide that option and keeping it always disabled for 3.x. Enabling it opened a whole can of worms and fixing this for Android 5 and 6 would be really challenging.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3060122082/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3068215789","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108433#issuecomment-3068215789","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108433","id":3068215789,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc624UHt","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-14T07:50:38Z","updated_at":"2025-07-14T07:50:38Z","body":"> The NDK related changes look good! From my pov, it's fine keeping them in separate commits to make it easy to track the changes, but I'll let @lawnjelly decide whether they should be squashed or not.\r\n\r\nYeah I'm fine with a couple of commits if they do separate things.\r\n\r\nFix for compile errors would be good to squash though, when you get it working. :+1: ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3068215789/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3080051643","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108433#issuecomment-3080051643","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108433","id":3080051643,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63ldu7","user":{"login":"WolfgangSenff","id":148612,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODYxMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/148612?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff","html_url":"https://github.com/WolfgangSenff","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-16T19:45:43Z","updated_at":"2025-07-16T19:45:43Z","body":"Okay. I think I've figured out what the issue was, but I'm not sure if I solved it the way you want. The issue seemed to be that the minimum API target was still 21 and the code for getting it in detect.py was never returning the value I was expecting, which was odd, and that was an issue because the NDK had two different sets of headers based on if it was 21 or 24+, with the current-most NDK version; I noticed some changes in 4.x that were similar to what I've made here, so I've resolved it by simply setting the min target to 24, but I also had to replace a value in detect.py to match 4.x. This loses Godot coverage on roughly 0.7% of the current Android marketplace, so I deemed it okay, but let me know if there's a better solution, or if you'd prefer something else. I'm letting it build now, but actually have one more potential commit that may or may not be necessary based on my local build, I'm just seeing if it'll work without it. And one last thing: I'm leaving this as draft for now, but only because I still have to attempt to upload this to the actual Play store and see what it does. I've run it fine on my device and everything looks good, but good to test everything.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3080051643/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3083411799","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108433#issuecomment-3083411799","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108433","id":3083411799,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63ySFX","user":{"login":"WolfgangSenff","id":148612,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODYxMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/148612?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff","html_url":"https://github.com/WolfgangSenff","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfgangSenff/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-17T09:53:29Z","updated_at":"2025-07-17T09:53:29Z","body":"Okay. @m4gr3d and @syntaxerror247 - not crazy happy with the fix I implemented here, but it turns out basically the min SDK has to be at least 24, for the reasons mentioned above. How I solved that was a little bit lazy: I just hard-coded it into the detect.py file, based on something I found in the 4.x codebase, which is admittedly different, but required the least number of changes to other files. Let me know if that's okay. If so, I believe this is ready to go.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3083411799/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3083730326","html_url":"https