al/lib/android/sdk/ndk/27.3.13750724/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/linux-x86_64/bin/../sysroot/usr/include/stdio.h:208:6: note: 'ftell' declared here\r\n  208 | long ftell(FILE* _Nonnull __fp);\r\n      |      ^\r\n2 errors generated.\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3164882813/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3164917957","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108433#issuecomment-3164917957","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108433","id":3164917957,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68pNDF","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-07T16:24:31Z","updated_at":"2025-08-07T16:24:31Z","body":"I was able to get this build by updating the `ndk-platform` to `24` while keeping min_sdk at 21. Howeve